content:
The stuck approvals all have `callback_due = null`, which means workflow never received a response from supplier-api when it made the approval requests (a successful call would populate `callback_due`). All requests started around t=530, shortly after the payment-service deploy at t=425. There are no workflow ERROR logs, which is unusual — it suggests workflow may not even be attempting to call supplier-api (or is silently failing). Let me check the supplier-api connectivity and workflow's open DB sessions/config.

```json
{
  "investigate": [
    {
      "tool": "sql",
      "query": "SELECT * FROM db_sessions WHERE service = 'workflow'",
      "why": "Check if workflow has open database sessions — zero sessions would indicate the workflow process is stuck or not running, explaining why no errors are logged and no callbacks are set."
    },
    {
      "tool": "sql",
      "query": "SELECT * FROM config WHERE key LIKE '%supplier%' OR key LIKE '%workflow%' OR key LIKE '%approval%'",
      "why": "Check for any configuration that controls supplier-api endpoint or approval behaviour, to see if a config change could explain why callback_due is never populated."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "service": "supplier-api",
      "kind": "external_dependency",
      "mechanism": "The external supplier-api is not responding to approval requests, so workflow never receives a callback and callback_due is never populated for any approval row.",
      "supporting": ["E1", "E6", "E7", "E8"],
      "refuting": ["E9"],
      "explains": ["I4_workflow_progress"],
      "repair_plan": [
        {"action": "rerequest_supplier_approvals", "params": {}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "service": "workflow",
      "kind": "runtime_fault",
      "mechanism": "The workflow process is stuck in a bad state (no errors logged, no callbacks set), preventing it from completing supplier-api calls and populating callback_due.",
      "supporting": ["E1", "E4", "E8", "E9"],
      "refuting": [],
      "explains": ["I4_workflow_progress"],
      "repair_plan": [
        {"action": "restart_service", "params": {"service": "workflow"}},
        {"action": "rerequest_supplier_approvals", "params": {}}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "summary": "All 20+ stuck approvals have null callback_due (supplier-api never acknowledged) and workflow logs no errors, pointing either to a silent external supplier-api failure or a workflow runtime fault; one more investigation step will distinguish between them."
}
```
